---
// TextPhotoCTA.astro - High-converting SMS photo quote banner
---

<div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 via-blue-800 to-indigo-900 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 shadow-xl border border-blue-500/30 text-white flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6 relative overflow-hidden my-12">
  
  <div class="absolute -right-10 -bottom-10 opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
    <svg class="w-64 h-64 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1" d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01M9 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-5l-5 5v-5z"/>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="flex-1 relative z-10 text-center md:text-left">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-900/60 border border-blue-400/40 text-blue-100 text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wider uppercase mb-3 shadow-inner">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-400 animate-pulse"></span> Get an Instant Quote
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black font-sans tracking-tight mb-3">
      Not sure which key you have?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-blue-100 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto md:mx-0 leading-relaxed font-medium">
      Transponder? Proximity Smart Fob? Don't guess. <strong class="text-white">Text a photo</strong> of your current key or lock directly to our shop phone, and we'll reply with an exact price and ETA in minutes.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto flex flex-col items-center">
    <a 
      href="sms:6156258000" 
      class="w-full md:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-8 py-4 bg-white hover:bg-amber-50 text-blue-800 font-black text-base sm:text-lg uppercase tracking-wider rounded-xl shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgb(0,0,0,0.12)] active:scale-95 transition-all border-b-4 border-slate-200 hover:border-amber-200"
    >
      <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-blue-600 shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M3 9a2 2 0 012-2h.93a2 2 0 001.664-.89l.812-1.22A2 2 0 0110.07 4h3.86a2 2 0 011.664.89l.812 1.22A2 2 0 0018.07 7H19a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V9z" />
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M15 13a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" />
      </svg>
      <span>Text Us A Photo</span>
    </a>
    <div class="text-center mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-blue-200 flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 opacity-90">
      <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-blue-300" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
      Direct to local technician
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
